# GunBonsai configuration for the Lance.
#
# Harmless when GunBonsai is not loaded -- the lump is simply never read.
#
# WHY THIS IS NEEDED. GunBonsai autodetects a weapon's type by inspecting
# the damage event (TFLV_WeaponInfo.InferWeaponTypeFromDamage), looking at
# whether the inflictor was a missile, a puff, and so on. The Lance is a
# beam: it deals damage directly with DamageMobj and no projectile and no
# puff exists to inspect, so autodetection has nothing to go on and will
# guess. A wrong guess means the wrong upgrade pool is offered -- projectile
# upgrades on a hitscan weapon do nothing, which is the "cards offered,
# taken, silently inert" failure this project has hit before.
#
# HITSCAN is the honest answer: the damage is instant along a ray, which is
# what every hitscan upgrade assumes. It is not "the beam is a bullet".

type LNC_Lance LNC_LanceOffhand : HITSCAN ;
